+
+Exception group diagnostics on asyncio
+-------------------------------------
+
+A cancelled scope filters recognized AnyIO cancellation leaves from a mixed
+exception group while propagating the remaining errors. Native cancellation
+exceptions that do not represent AnyIO scope cancellation are retained.
+Filtering preserves group structure, repeated occurrences and unchanged group
+objects. Changed ancestors use the group's ``derive()`` protocol, preserve
+diagnostic metadata, and receive independent note lists. Shared changed subgroups
+remain shared in the result. The original exception tree is not modified.
+Task-group wrappers suppress redundant context display without erasing user
+causes, contexts or notes.
